  "rationale": "The one home (SPEC_STANDARD 15.4) of every policy value that generated code reads: typed constants of one deterministic provider module, because the Factory data/code seam (SPEC_STANDARD 15.9) gives a generator an access signature and never a value, and an address in a note is not dereferenced (SPEC_STANDARD 15.3.1). Each value is decided in the State 2 decision named by source_refs and written here once. Release ceilings are one scalar constant each (A20 rule 1, owner 2026-10-03). The trapped entry points are written out for release v1, CPython 3.12 (A03 rule 4, A20 rule 3): SANDBOX_TRAPPED_FUNCTIONS raise on any call, SANDBOX_TRAPPED_WITHOUT_ARGUMENT only when called without an argument, every method of SANDBOX_TRAPPED_CLASS raises, and SANDBOX_UNSEEDED_CONSTRUCTOR raises when constructed without a seed or with None. SERVICE_ID_PATTERN is anchored at both ends with \\Z, so it decides the whole service_id under re.match and re.search alike (A08 rule 1). Closed sets that belong to a model - disclosure and effect classes, statuses, reasons, HTTP methods - are models enumerations, ordered by their declared order where State 1 orders them; the field names of a manifest record are the fields of its model. Neither repeats here.",
